<title>IRAN: Iran president nominates Namazi economy minister.</title>
<headline>Iran president nominates Namazi economy minister.</headline>
<dateline>TEHRAN 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran's new President Mohammad Khatami on Tuesday nominated Hossein Namazi as economy and finance minister, the official news agency IRNA reported.</p>
<p>If approved by the parliament, Namazi will replace Morteza Mohammadkhan. Namazi held the post from 1982 to 1986.</p>
